  "title": "Erdős Problem #813",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $h(n)$ be minimal such that every graph on $n$ vertices where every set of $7$ vertices contains a triangle (a copy of $K_3$) must contain a clique on at least $h(n)$ vertices. Estimate $h(n)$ - in particular, do there exist constants $c_1,c_2>0$ such that $ n^{1/3+c_1}\\ll h(n) \\ll n^{1/2-c_2}? $ ",
